# The Leader and the Follower (Q123), the araneid leg needs the sponsor: at cond 7 the araneid drops no leg while the sponsor is out of the world, the quest kept; with the sponsor in the world beside, the eighth leg moves the quest to cond 8.
# Expectations are derived from the reference source (Q123_TheLeaderAndTheFollower.java, Quest.getSponsor and Quest.getApprentice)
# and the clan mate lines of the scenario format (#4175).
character Pupil 19
clan 3
mate Chief 19 leader sponsor
quest Q123_TheLeaderAndTheFollower <cond>=7 <state>=STARTED state=4 stateEx=1
hold 8550 7
random always 0
script quest.Q123_TheLeaderAndTheFollower
item 1458 7850 7851 7852 7853 7854 7855 7856 7857 7858 7859 8549 8550
page villagemaster/31961.htm
page script/quest/Q123_TheLeaderAndTheFollower/
npc newyear 31961 VillageMasterDwarf 10 0 0
npc araneid 27322 Monster 40 0 0

kill araneid
  S SystemMessage id=95 1:0 1:0
  items 8550=7
enter Chief
  S SystemMessage id=304 0:"Chief"
  S SystemMessage id=1758 0:"Chief"
kill araneid
  S SystemMessage id=95 1:0 1:0
  S SystemMessage id=54 3:8550
  S PlaySound type=0 file=ItemSound.quest_middle bind=0 obj=0 loc=0,0,0 delay=0
  S QuestList 123:0x800000ff
  S ExShowQuestMark quest=123
  Q upsert Q123_TheLeaderAndTheFollower | <cond> | 8
  items 8550=8
